{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/1467058-sin-again-daeva-now-available-on-storytellers-vault-2e-requiem-clan-book","id":1467058,"title":"Sin Again: Daeva Now Available on Storytellers Vault (2E Requiem Clan Book)","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Vampire: The Requiem"],"posts":[{"date":"2021-11-07T09:40:31-08:00","id":1467058,"title":"Sin Again: Daeva Now Available on Storytellers Vault (2E Requiem Clan Book)","content":"Oh hey, look who turned up\u2026<br /> <br /> <b>Link: </b><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/376645/Sin-Again-Daeva?affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Sin Again: Daeva</b></a><br /> <div align=\"center\"><i>We've met before and will again.</i><br /> <i>You'll see me under neon lights<br /> with a drink in my hand<br /> and your name on my lips.</i><br /> <i>You'll find me lounging on a chaise<br /> with nothing but your eyes upon my body.</i><br /> <i>You'll catch me in the seat across the aisle,<br /> and pacing by your office door,<br /> and watching from your bedroom mirror.</i><br /> <i>And you won't be able to stop me.</i><br /> <i>\u2014 Vivian Sharpe, Acolyte evangelist</i></div> <br /> <br /> The Serpents are obsession defined. To know them is to want them, and to want them is to need them \u2014 but never as much as they\u2019ll need you. Now, for the first time in over 13 years, bask again in the glorious blasphemies of Clan Daeva.<br /> <br /> <b>Sin Again</b> is a complete guide to the Daeva in <b>Vampire: The Requiem Second Edition</b>, with updates and expansions to their original clan book, <b>Kiss of the Succubus</b>. It includes:<ul><li>Eight Serpent bloodlines: The Children of Judas, Duchagne, Erzs\u00e9bet, Gulikan, Nelapsi, and Xiao, dying to remake your acquaintance, along with new cousins like the cutting edge Moda Mortale and time-defying Star-Crossed.</li> <li>An in-depth exploration of Kindred parties and social gatherings, with a special system to help you run your own bloody blowouts.</li> <li>Four ghoul families and numerous horrors to play upon your heartstrings, featuring the return of the Nemites, not seen since <b>The Danse Macabre</b>, and new insights into Solace, designer drug of the Damned.</li> <li>Exciting new fiction from the <b>Chronicles of Darkness: Chicago</b> setting.</li> <li>Devotions, Merits, banes, and more tools for players and Storytellers alike!</li> </ul><br /> If you\u2019re a Daeva fan (or just a <b>Requiem </b>fan in general), this one\u2019s for you. Not only have we got eight new and updated bloodlines and four (4!) ghoul families, we\u2019ve got three new horrors, a covenant, and dozens of new Merits and Devotions. I\u2019m extremely proud of this book, and I hope it lives up to the expectations we set with <b>False Gods </b>and other supplements. I\u2019ll be posting excerpts here very soon, but for now, here a few bundle links. Because of the way DTRPG works, if you\u2019ve bought some of these books previously, this is a good way to get a discount on the new release.<br /> <br /> <b>Courtiers and Courtesans (Sin Again: Daeva and False Gods: Ventrue):</b> <b><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/376651/Courtiers-and-Courtesans-BUNDLE?affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\">Link</a></b><br /> <br /> <b>Clan Book Four Pack (All four NMD clan books at a big discount. If you already have the other three titles, this is a great way to get Sin Again for cheap!):</b> <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/376652/Clan-Book-Four-Pack-BUNDLE?affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\"><b>Link</b></a><br /> <br /> <b>Twists of the Blood (All the clan books, plus Bloodlines: The Resurrected and Bloodlines: The Devoted):</b> <b><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/358556/Twists-of-the-Blood-BUNDLE?affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\">Link</a></b><br /> <br /> And with that, I\u2019m going to go take a short torpor. Enjoy the book! As always, please consider leaving us a review! It's <i>so </i>helpful to getting people to consider buying our books. Because of changes on the STV front page, we're a bit less visible, so share that link if you know some people who might be interested!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><hr /><b>Social justice vampire/freelancer | He/Him</b><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Actual Play:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/852858-vampire-the-requiem-%E2%80%93-bloodlines-ap\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire: The Requiem \u2013 Bloodlines</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Masquiem:</b></span> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/vampire-the-requiem/5268-13-licks-the-curses-of-caine-in-blood-smoke\" target=\"_blank\">Curses of Caine in Requiem 2nd</a><br /> <span style=\"color:#A52A2A\"><b>Storytellers Vault: </b></span><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=None%20More%20Dark%20Publishing#affiliate_id=321925\" target=\"_blank\">Author Page</a>","edited":{"userid":192,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","user":"Yossarian","date":". 12-12-2021, 06:13 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":11}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/192-yossarian","name":"Yossarian","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar192_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2297"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2021-11-07T10:23:34-08:00","id":1467067,"title":"","content":"Is it racket if I willingly give my money ?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link"